{"strongs": "H4809", "word": "מְרִיבָה", "translit": "me.ri.vah", "root": "רטט", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "place of strife", "definition": "II. מְרִיבָה proper name, of a location ( place of strife ); — 1. at Rephidim, ׳ מַסָּה וּמ Exod 17:7 ( J ), Λοιδόρησις . 2. at Kadesh, especially in מֵי מְרִיבָה water of M. ( ᵐ5 ὕδωρ ἁντιλογίας ) Deut 33:8 ; Num 20:13 ( P ) Ps 81:8 ; Ps 106:32 , also ( ᵐ5 ὕδωρ τῆς λοιδορίας ᵐ5 L as above) Num 20:24 ( P ); ׳ מ construct in מֵי מְרִיבַת קָדֵשׁ ( ᵐ5 ὕδωρ ἁντιλογίας [ἑν] Καδης ) Num 27:14 ; Deut 32:51 (both P ), and ( ᵐ5 ὕδωρ βαριμωθ Καδης Ezek 48:28 so מֵי מְרִיבוֺת ׳ ק Ezek 47:19 ( ᵐ5 ὕδωρ Μαριμωθ Καδης ); Deut 33:2 see קֹדֶשׁ near the end; מְרִיבָה along, only Ps 95:8 ( παραπικρασμός ; || יוֺם מַסָּה ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7905')\">BDB7905</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4809')\">H4809</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6946')\">H6946</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7904')\">BDB7904</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7906')\">BDB7906</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>מְרִיבָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> (<highlight>place of strife</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> at Rephidim, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַסָּה וּמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,7)\">Exod 17:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <grk>Λοιδόρησις</grk>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> at Kadesh, especially in <bdbheb>מֵי מְרִיבָה</bdbheb> <highlight>water of M.</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ὕδωρ ἁντιλογίας</grk>) <ref ref=\"Deut 33:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,8)\">Deut 33:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,13)\"